  id: ch4-b2
  title: "T\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh v\u1EC1 Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, do nh\xE2n d\xE2n, v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
  topic: "T\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh v\u1EC1 Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, do nh\xE2n d\xE2n, v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
  titleVN: "T\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh v\u1EC1 Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, do nh\xE2n d\xE2n, v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
  pages:
  - title: "B\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\u1EE7a Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc"
    titleVN: "B\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\u1EE7a Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc"
    contentVN: "Trong t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh, Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \"nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc to\xE0n d\xE2n\" theo ngh\u0129a phi giai c\u1EA5p. Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam D\xE2n ch\u1EE7 C\u1ED9ng h\xF2a mang b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n, th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n \u1EDF ba ph\u01B0\u01A1ng di\u1EC7n: (1) \u0110\u1EA3ng C\u1ED9ng s\u1EA3n Vi\u1EC7t Nam gi\u1EEF v\u1ECB tr\xED v\xE0 vai tr\xF2 c\u1EA7m quy\u1EC1n (L\u1EDDi n\xF3i \u0111\u1EA7u Hi\u1EBFn ph\xE1p n\u0103m 1959: Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 nh\xE2n d\xE2n, d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng li\xEAn minh c\xF4ng n\xF4ng, do giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n l\xE3nh \u0111\u1EA1o); \u0110\u1EA3ng c\u1EA7m quy\u1EC1n b\u1EB1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1ED1i, quan \u0111i\u1EC3m \u0111\u1EC3 Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EC3 ch\u1EBF h\xF3a; b\u1EB1ng ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EA3ng v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA3ng vi\xEAn trong b\u1ED9 m\xE1y nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc; b\u1EB1ng c\xF4ng t\xE1c ki\u1EC3m tra; (2) t\xEDnh \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng x\xE3 h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a; (3) nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c v\xE0 ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xE0 t\u1EADp trung d\xE2n ch\u1EE7.\n\nB\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t v\u1EDBi t\xEDnh nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 t\xEDnh d\xE2n t\u1ED9c: Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EA5u tranh c\u1EE7a to\xE0n th\u1EC3 d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 nh\xE2n d\xE2n \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn \u1EDF \u0110\xF4ng Nam \xC1; v\xEC quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, l\u1EA5y quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i d\xE2n t\u1ED9c l\xE0m n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng; \u0111\u1EA3m \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 to\xE0n d\xE2n t\u1ED9c giao ph\xF3. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.142-145)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam m\u1EDBi mang b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n, th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t v\u1EDBi t\xEDnh nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 t\xEDnh d\xE2n t\u1ED9c."
    content: "Trong t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh, Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \"nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc to\xE0n d\xE2n\" theo ngh\u0129a phi giai c\u1EA5p. Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam D\xE2n ch\u1EE7 C\u1ED9ng h\xF2a mang b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n, th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n \u1EDF ba ph\u01B0\u01A1ng di\u1EC7n: (1) \u0110\u1EA3ng C\u1ED9ng s\u1EA3n Vi\u1EC7t Nam gi\u1EEF v\u1ECB tr\xED v\xE0 vai tr\xF2 c\u1EA7m quy\u1EC1n (L\u1EDDi n\xF3i \u0111\u1EA7u Hi\u1EBFn ph\xE1p n\u0103m 1959: Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 nh\xE2n d\xE2n, d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng li\xEAn minh c\xF4ng n\xF4ng, do giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n l\xE3nh \u0111\u1EA1o); \u0110\u1EA3ng c\u1EA7m quy\u1EC1n b\u1EB1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1ED1i, quan \u0111i\u1EC3m \u0111\u1EC3 Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EC3 ch\u1EBF h\xF3a; b\u1EB1ng ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EA3ng v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA3ng vi\xEAn trong b\u1ED9 m\xE1y nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc; b\u1EB1ng c\xF4ng t\xE1c ki\u1EC3m tra; (2) t\xEDnh \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng x\xE3 h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a; (3) nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c v\xE0 ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xE0 t\u1EADp trung d\xE2n ch\u1EE7.\n\nB\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t v\u1EDBi t\xEDnh nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 t\xEDnh d\xE2n t\u1ED9c: Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EA5u tranh c\u1EE7a to\xE0n th\u1EC3 d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 nh\xE2n d\xE2n \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn \u1EDF \u0110\xF4ng Nam \xC1; v\xEC quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, l\u1EA5y quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i d\xE2n t\u1ED9c l\xE0m n\u1EC1n t\u1EA3ng; \u0111\u1EA3m \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 to\xE0n d\xE2n t\u1ED9c giao ph\xF3. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.142-145)"
    example: 
    takeaway: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam m\u1EDBi mang b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t giai c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng nh\xE2n, th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t v\u1EDBi t\xEDnh nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 t\xEDnh d\xE2n t\u1ED9c."
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
  - title: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
    titleVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
    contentVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\xE0 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u1ECDi quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c trong nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 trong x\xE3 h\u1ED9i \u0111\u1EC1u thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 nh\xE2n d\xE2n: \"d\xE2n l\xE0 ch\u1EE7\". Nh\xE2n d\xE2n th\u1EF1c thi quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c qua hai h\xECnh th\u1EE9c: d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp (nh\xE2n d\xE2n tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh c\xE1c v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 v\u1EADn m\u1EC7nh qu\u1ED1c gia; H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh coi \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 h\xECnh th\u1EE9c d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 ho\xE0n b\u1ECB nh\u1EA5t) v\xE0 d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 gi\xE1n ti\u1EBFp (\u0111\u1EA1i di\u1EC7n).\n\nTrong d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 gi\xE1n ti\u1EBFp: quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 \"th\u1EEBa \u1EE7y quy\u1EC1n\" c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n; c\xE1c c\u01A1 quan v\xE0 c\xE1n b\u1ED9 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1EC1u l\xE0 c\xF4ng b\u1ED9c c\u1EE7a d\xE2n, \u0111\u1EC3 g\xE1nh v\xE1c vi\u1EC7c chung cho d\xE2n ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xE8 \u0111\u1EA7u d\xE2n; Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xF3i l\xE0m \u0111\u1EA7y t\u1EDB cho nh\xE2n d\xE2n ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0m quan c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng. Nh\xE2n d\xE2n c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t, ph\xEA b\xECnh nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc, quy\u1EC1n b\xE3i mi\u1EC5n \u0111\u1EA1i bi\u1EC3u; n\u1EBFu Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 l\xE0m h\u1EA1i d\xE2n th\xEC d\xE2n c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n \u0111u\u1ED5i Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7. Lu\u1EADt ph\xE1p d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 l\xE0 c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.145-148)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "Quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 \"th\u1EEBa \u1EE7y quy\u1EC1n\" c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n; c\xE1n b\u1ED9 l\xE0 c\xF4ng b\u1ED9c c\u1EE7a d\xE2n."
    content: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\xE0 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u1ECDi quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c trong nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 trong x\xE3 h\u1ED9i \u0111\u1EC1u thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 nh\xE2n d\xE2n: \"d\xE2n l\xE0 ch\u1EE7\". Nh\xE2n d\xE2n th\u1EF1c thi quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c qua hai h\xECnh th\u1EE9c: d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp (nh\xE2n d\xE2n tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh c\xE1c v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 v\u1EADn m\u1EC7nh qu\u1ED1c gia; H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh coi \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 h\xECnh th\u1EE9c d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 ho\xE0n b\u1ECB nh\u1EA5t) v\xE0 d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 gi\xE1n ti\u1EBFp (\u0111\u1EA1i di\u1EC7n).\n\nTrong d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 gi\xE1n ti\u1EBFp: quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 \"th\u1EEBa \u1EE7y quy\u1EC1n\" c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n; c\xE1c c\u01A1 quan v\xE0 c\xE1n b\u1ED9 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1EC1u l\xE0 c\xF4ng b\u1ED9c c\u1EE7a d\xE2n, \u0111\u1EC3 g\xE1nh v\xE1c vi\u1EC7c chung cho d\xE2n ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xE8 \u0111\u1EA7u d\xE2n; Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xF3i l\xE0m \u0111\u1EA7y t\u1EDB cho nh\xE2n d\xE2n ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0m quan c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng. Nh\xE2n d\xE2n c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t, ph\xEA b\xECnh nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc, quy\u1EC1n b\xE3i mi\u1EC5n \u0111\u1EA1i bi\u1EC3u; n\u1EBFu Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 l\xE0m h\u1EA1i d\xE2n th\xEC d\xE2n c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n \u0111u\u1ED5i Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7. Lu\u1EADt ph\xE1p d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 l\xE0 c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.145-148)"
    example: 
    takeaway: "Quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 \"th\u1EEBa \u1EE7y quy\u1EC1n\" c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n; c\xE1n b\u1ED9 l\xE0 c\xF4ng b\u1ED9c c\u1EE7a d\xE2n."
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
  - title: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
    titleVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n"
    contentVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do nh\xE2n d\xE2n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\u1EADp n\xEAn, \"c\u1EED ra\", \"t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c n\xEAn\" theo tr\xECnh t\u1EF1 d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\u1EDBi c\xE1c quy\u1EC1n b\u1EA7u c\u1EED, ph\xFAc quy\u1EBFt. \u0110\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi l\xE0 \"d\xE2n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7\": nh\xE2n d\xE2n c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 th\xEC ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 l\xE0m tr\xF2n b\u1ED5n ph\u1EADn c\xF4ng d\xE2n, gi\u1EEF \u0111\xFAng \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c c\xF4ng d\xE2n. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xF3i: \"Ch\xFAng ta l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi lao \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\xE0. Mu\u1ED1n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1t, ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c l\xE0m ch\u1EE7\".\n\nNh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 l\u1EE3i \xEDch v\xE0 nguy\u1EC7n v\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EB7c quy\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EB7c l\u1EE3i, th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 trong s\u1EA1ch, c\u1EA7n, ki\u1EC7m, li\xEAm, ch\xEDnh. Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 nh\xE2n d\xE2n bao gi\u1EDD c\u0169ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EB7t quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i d\xE2n l\xEAn tr\xEAn h\u1EBFt th\u1EA3y; vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 l\u1EE3i cho d\xE2n th\xEC l\xE0m, vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 h\u1EA1i cho d\xE2n th\xEC ph\u1EA3i tr\xE1nh. Th\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111o m\u1ED9t Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xEC d\xE2n l\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xF2ng d\xE2n. C\xE1n b\u1ED9 v\u1EEBa l\xE0 \u0111\u1EA7y t\u1EDB (trung th\xE0nh, t\u1EADn t\u1EE5y, c\u1EA7n, ki\u1EC7m, li\xEAm, ch\xEDnh, ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0) v\u1EEBa l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\xE3nh \u0111\u1EA1o (tr\xED tu\u1EC7, s\xE1ng su\u1ED1t, nh\xECn xa tr\xF4ng r\u1ED9ng, g\u1EA7n g\u0169i nh\xE2n d\xE2n); ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EE9c v\xE0 t\xE0i. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.148-150)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do d\xE2n: d\xE2n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7, c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i v\xE0 ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5; nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xEC d\xE2n: \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xF2ng d\xE2n, kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EB7c quy\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EB7c l\u1EE3i."
    content: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do nh\xE2n d\xE2n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\u1EADp n\xEAn, \"c\u1EED ra\", \"t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c n\xEAn\" theo tr\xECnh t\u1EF1 d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\u1EDBi c\xE1c quy\u1EC1n b\u1EA7u c\u1EED, ph\xFAc quy\u1EBFt. \u0110\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi l\xE0 \"d\xE2n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7\": nh\xE2n d\xE2n c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 th\xEC ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 l\xE0m tr\xF2n b\u1ED5n ph\u1EADn c\xF4ng d\xE2n, gi\u1EEF \u0111\xFAng \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c c\xF4ng d\xE2n. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xF3i: \"Ch\xFAng ta l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi lao \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\xE0. Mu\u1ED1n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED1t, ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c l\xE0m ch\u1EE7\".\n\nNh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 l\u1EE3i \xEDch v\xE0 nguy\u1EC7n v\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EB7c quy\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EB7c l\u1EE3i, th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 trong s\u1EA1ch, c\u1EA7n, ki\u1EC7m, li\xEAm, ch\xEDnh. Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 nh\xE2n d\xE2n bao gi\u1EDD c\u0169ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EB7t quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i d\xE2n l\xEAn tr\xEAn h\u1EBFt th\u1EA3y; vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 l\u1EE3i cho d\xE2n th\xEC l\xE0m, vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 h\u1EA1i cho d\xE2n th\xEC ph\u1EA3i tr\xE1nh. Th\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111o m\u1ED9t Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xEC d\xE2n l\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xF2ng d\xE2n. C\xE1n b\u1ED9 v\u1EEBa l\xE0 \u0111\u1EA7y t\u1EDB (trung th\xE0nh, t\u1EADn t\u1EE5y, c\u1EA7n, ki\u1EC7m, li\xEAm, ch\xEDnh, ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0) v\u1EEBa l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\xE3nh \u0111\u1EA1o (tr\xED tu\u1EC7, s\xE1ng su\u1ED1t, nh\xECn xa tr\xF4ng r\u1ED9ng, g\u1EA7n g\u0169i nh\xE2n d\xE2n); ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EE9c v\xE0 t\xE0i. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.148-150)"
    example: 
    takeaway: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc do d\xE2n: d\xE2n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7, c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EE3i v\xE0 ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5; nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xEC d\xE2n: \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xF2ng d\xE2n, kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EB7c quy\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EB7c l\u1EE3i."
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
  - title: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\xE1p quy\u1EC1n"
    titleVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\xE1p quy\u1EC1n"
    contentVN: "H\u1EE3p hi\u1EBFn, h\u1EE3p ph\xE1p: trong Y\xEAu s\xE1ch c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n An Nam (1919), Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF2i thay th\u1EBF ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 ra c\xE1c s\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 ra c\xE1c \u0111\u1EA1o lu\u1EADt. Ng\xE0y 3/9/1945, \u1EDF phi\xEAn h\u1ECDp \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 l\xE2m th\u1EDDi, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EC1 ngh\u1ECB c\xF3 m\u1ED9t hi\u1EBFn ph\xE1p d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\xE0 t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c c\xE0ng s\u1EDBm c\xE0ng hay cu\u1ED9c T\u1ED5ng tuy\u1EC3n c\u1EED v\u1EDBi ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 ph\u1ED5 th\xF4ng \u0111\u1EA7u phi\u1EBFu. T\u1ED5ng tuy\u1EC3n c\u1EED th\u1EAFng l\u1EE3i ng\xE0y 6/1/1946: m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n t\u1EEB 18 tu\u1ED5i tr\u1EDF l\xEAn, kh\xF4ng ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t nam n\u1EEF, gi\xE0u ngh\xE8o, d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, \u0111\u1EA3ng ph\xE1i, t\xF4n gi\xE1o \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. Ng\xE0y 2/3/1946, Qu\u1ED1c h\u1ED9i kho\xE1 I h\u1ECDp phi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn; H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EA7u l\xE0m Ch\u1EE7 t\u1ECBch Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 li\xEAn hi\u1EC7p \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn.\n\nTh\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\xF4n ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt: Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi hai l\u1EA7n tham gia l\xE3nh \u0111\u1EA1o so\u1EA1n th\u1EA3o Hi\u1EBFn ph\xE1p (n\u0103m 1946 v\xE0 1959), k\xFD l\u1EC7nh c\xF4ng b\u1ED1 16 \u0111\u1EA1o lu\u1EADt, 613 s\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh (trong \u0111\xF3 243 s\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh v\u1EC1 t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt). Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi khuy\u1EBFn kh\xEDch nh\xE2n d\xE2n gi\xE1m s\xE1t, \u0111\xF2i h\u1ECFi c\xE1n b\u1ED9 t\u01B0 ph\xE1p n\xEAu cao \"ph\u1EE5ng c\xF4ng, th\u1EE7 ph\xE1p, ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0\".\n\nPh\xE1p quy\u1EC1n nh\xE2n ngh\u0129a: Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xF4n tr\u1ECDng v\xE0 b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA3m quy\u1EC1n con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, trong \u0111\xF3 quy\u1EC1n cao nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 quy\u1EC1n s\u1ED1ng; ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt c\xF3 t\xEDnh nh\xE2n v\u0103n, khuy\u1EBFn thi\u1EC7n, l\u1EA5y gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c, c\u1EA3m h\xF3a l\xE0m c\u0103n b\u1EA3n (Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tuy\xEAn b\u1ED1: s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ai b\u1ECB t\xE0n s\xE1t). (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.151-155)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "T\u1ED5ng tuy\u1EC3n c\u1EED ng\xE0y 6/1/1946; Qu\u1ED1c h\u1ED9i kho\xE1 I h\u1ECDp ng\xE0y 2/3/1946."
    content: "H\u1EE3p hi\u1EBFn, h\u1EE3p ph\xE1p: trong Y\xEAu s\xE1ch c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n An Nam (1919), Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF2i thay th\u1EBF ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 ra c\xE1c s\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 ra c\xE1c \u0111\u1EA1o lu\u1EADt. Ng\xE0y 3/9/1945, \u1EDF phi\xEAn h\u1ECDp \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 l\xE2m th\u1EDDi, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EC1 ngh\u1ECB c\xF3 m\u1ED9t hi\u1EBFn ph\xE1p d\xE2n ch\u1EE7 v\xE0 t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c c\xE0ng s\u1EDBm c\xE0ng hay cu\u1ED9c T\u1ED5ng tuy\u1EC3n c\u1EED v\u1EDBi ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 ph\u1ED5 th\xF4ng \u0111\u1EA7u phi\u1EBFu. T\u1ED5ng tuy\u1EC3n c\u1EED th\u1EAFng l\u1EE3i ng\xE0y 6/1/1946: m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n t\u1EEB 18 tu\u1ED5i tr\u1EDF l\xEAn, kh\xF4ng ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t nam n\u1EEF, gi\xE0u ngh\xE8o, d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, \u0111\u1EA3ng ph\xE1i, t\xF4n gi\xE1o \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. Ng\xE0y 2/3/1946, Qu\u1ED1c h\u1ED9i kho\xE1 I h\u1ECDp phi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn; H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EA7u l\xE0m Ch\u1EE7 t\u1ECBch Ch\xEDnh ph\u1EE7 li\xEAn hi\u1EC7p \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn.\n\nTh\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\xF4n ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt: Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi hai l\u1EA7n tham gia l\xE3nh \u0111\u1EA1o so\u1EA1n th\u1EA3o Hi\u1EBFn ph\xE1p (n\u0103m 1946 v\xE0 1959), k\xFD l\u1EC7nh c\xF4ng b\u1ED1 16 \u0111\u1EA1o lu\u1EADt, 613 s\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh (trong \u0111\xF3 243 s\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh v\u1EC1 t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt). Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi khuy\u1EBFn kh\xEDch nh\xE2n d\xE2n gi\xE1m s\xE1t, \u0111\xF2i h\u1ECFi c\xE1n b\u1ED9 t\u01B0 ph\xE1p n\xEAu cao \"ph\u1EE5ng c\xF4ng, th\u1EE7 ph\xE1p, ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0\".\n\nPh\xE1p quy\u1EC1n nh\xE2n ngh\u0129a: Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xF4n tr\u1ECDng v\xE0 b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA3m quy\u1EC1n con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, trong \u0111\xF3 quy\u1EC1n cao nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 quy\u1EC1n s\u1ED1ng; ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt c\xF3 t\xEDnh nh\xE2n v\u0103n, khuy\u1EBFn thi\u1EC7n, l\u1EA5y gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c, c\u1EA3m h\xF3a l\xE0m c\u0103n b\u1EA3n (Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tuy\xEAn b\u1ED1: s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ai b\u1ECB t\xE0n s\xE1t). (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.151-155)"
    example: 
    takeaway: "T\u1ED5ng tuy\u1EC3n c\u1EED ng\xE0y 6/1/1946; Qu\u1ED1c h\u1ED9i kho\xE1 I h\u1ECDp ng\xE0y 2/3/1946."
