    takeaway: "Ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1c g\u1ED3m ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t c\u1EE7a \u0110\u1EA3ng, ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t b\xEAn trong Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n."
