  - title: "Ph\xF2ng, ch\u1ED1ng ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c trong Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc"
    titleVN: "Ph\xF2ng, ch\u1ED1ng ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c trong Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc"
    contentVN: "H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh n\xF3i \u0111\u1EBFn c\xE1c ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c: \u0111\u1EB7c quy\u1EC1n, \u0111\u1EB7c l\u1EE3i; tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED, quan li\xEAu (l\xE0 \"gi\u1EB7c n\u1ED9i x\xE2m\", nguy hi\u1EC3m h\u01A1n gi\u1EB7c ngo\u1EA1i x\xE2m); \"t\u01B0 t\xFAng\", \"chia r\u1EBD\", \"ki\xEAu ng\u1EA1o\". Ng\xE0y 27/11/1946, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\xFD S\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh \u1EA5n \u0111\u1ECBnh h\xECnh ph\u1EA1t t\u1ED9i \u0111\u01B0a v\xE0 nh\u1EADn h\u1ED1i l\u1ED9 t\u1EEB 5 n\u0103m \u0111\u1EBFn 20 n\u0103m t\xF9 kh\u1ED5 sai; ng\xE0y 26/1/1946, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\xFD l\u1EC7nh n\xF3i r\xF5 t\u1ED9i tham \xF4, tr\u1ED9m c\u1EAFp \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c cao nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 t\u1EED h\xECnh. B\u1EC7nh quan li\xEAu l\xE0 b\u1EC7nh g\u1ED1c sinh ra tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED; mu\u1ED1n tr\u1EEB s\u1EA1ch tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED th\xEC tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt ph\u1EA3i t\u1EA9y s\u1EA1ch b\u1EC7nh quan li\xEAu.\n\nNguy\xEAn nh\xE2n ch\u1EE7 quan b\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n t\u1EEB \"b\u1EC7nh m\u1EB9\" l\xE0 ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a c\xE1 nh\xE2n; b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n kh\xE1ch quan. N\u0103m bi\u1EC7n ph\xE1p c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n: (1) n\xE2ng cao tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ED9 d\xE2n ch\u1EE7, ph\xE1t huy quy\u1EC1n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\xE0 gi\u1EA3i ph\xE1p c\u0103n b\u1EA3n, l\xE2u d\xE0i; (2) ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt c\u1EE7a Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc, k\u1EF7 lu\u1EADt c\u1EE7a \u0110\u1EA3ng ph\u1EA3i nghi\xEAm minh, ki\u1EC3m tra th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn; (3) coi tr\u1ECDng gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c, c\u1EA3m h\xF3a, \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c; (4) c\xE1n b\u1ED9 ph\u1EA3i \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0m g\u01B0\u01A1ng; (5) huy \u0111\u1ED9ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a y\xEAu n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.159-162)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "B\u1EC7nh quan li\xEAu l\xE0 b\u1EC7nh g\u1ED1c sinh ra tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED; \"b\u1EC7nh m\u1EB9\" l\xE0 ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a c\xE1 nh\xE2n."
    content: "H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh n\xF3i \u0111\u1EBFn c\xE1c ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c: \u0111\u1EB7c quy\u1EC1n, \u0111\u1EB7c l\u1EE3i; tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED, quan li\xEAu (l\xE0 \"gi\u1EB7c n\u1ED9i x\xE2m\", nguy hi\u1EC3m h\u01A1n gi\u1EB7c ngo\u1EA1i x\xE2m); \"t\u01B0 t\xFAng\", \"chia r\u1EBD\", \"ki\xEAu ng\u1EA1o\". Ng\xE0y 27/11/1946, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\xFD S\u1EAFc l\u1EC7nh \u1EA5n \u0111\u1ECBnh h\xECnh ph\u1EA1t t\u1ED9i \u0111\u01B0a v\xE0 nh\u1EADn h\u1ED1i l\u1ED9 t\u1EEB 5 n\u0103m \u0111\u1EBFn 20 n\u0103m t\xF9 kh\u1ED5 sai; ng\xE0y 26/1/1946, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\xFD l\u1EC7nh n\xF3i r\xF5 t\u1ED9i tham \xF4, tr\u1ED9m c\u1EAFp \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c cao nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 t\u1EED h\xECnh. B\u1EC7nh quan li\xEAu l\xE0 b\u1EC7nh g\u1ED1c sinh ra tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED; mu\u1ED1n tr\u1EEB s\u1EA1ch tham \xF4, l\xE3ng ph\xED th\xEC tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt ph\u1EA3i t\u1EA9y s\u1EA1ch b\u1EC7nh quan li\xEAu.\n\nNguy\xEAn nh\xE2n ch\u1EE7 quan b\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n t\u1EEB \"b\u1EC7nh m\u1EB9\" l\xE0 ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a c\xE1 nh\xE2n; b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n kh\xE1ch quan. N\u0103m bi\u1EC7n ph\xE1p c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n: (1) n\xE2ng cao tr\xECnh \u0111\u1ED9 d\xE2n ch\u1EE7, ph\xE1t huy quy\u1EC1n l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n l\xE0 gi\u1EA3i ph\xE1p c\u0103n b\u1EA3n, l\xE2u d\xE0i; (2) ph\xE1p lu\u1EADt c\u1EE7a Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc, k\u1EF7 lu\u1EADt c\u1EE7a \u0110\u1EA3ng ph\u1EA3i nghi\xEAm minh, ki\u1EC3m tra th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn; (3) coi tr\u1ECDng gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c, c\u1EA3m h\xF3a, \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t gi\xE1o d\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c; (4) c\xE1n b\u1ED9 ph\u1EA3i \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0m g\u01B0\u01A1ng; (5) huy \u0111\u1ED9ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a y\xEAu n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.159-162)"
